### GET /api/admin/events
# Cursor feed by id. Filters (AND): topic, resourceId, resourceUrl.
# Default order=asc (oldest first): pass the response's nextAfter as ?after= for the next page.
# order=desc (newest first): pass the response's nextBefore as ?before= for the next page.
# A null cursor means the end. limit 1..1000, default 100.

### First page
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/events?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Next page
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/events?after=100&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Newest first
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/events?order=desc&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Newest first, next page
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/events?order=desc&before=500&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filtered by topic and resource
GET {{adminUrl}}/api/admin/events?topic=reactions&resourceUrl=/blog/hello
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
